{"recordId":"minister_高太后","name":"高太后","type":"minister","dynasty":"北宋","title":"宣仁太后","canonicalName":null,"aliases":[],"identityStatus":"candidate","candidatePages":[{"title":"宣仁圣烈皇后","pageId":121374,"revisionId":94321743,"revisionTimestamp":"2026-09-12T17:40:02Z","url":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%AE%A3%E4%BB%81%E5%9C%A3%E7%83%88%E7%9A%87%E5%90%8E","revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94321743","wikidataId":"Q5219495","isDisambiguation":false,"bibliography":[{"citationTitle":"邵氏聞見錄/卷三","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"溫公日記","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"皇宋十朝纲要","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"宋史·后妃傳上·英宗宣仁聖烈高皇后","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"皇宋十朝纲要·[https://www.shidianguji.com/zh/book/CADAL02079708/chapter/1l5id200eebkf?version=15 卷七]","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"卷七","url":"https://www.shidianguji.com/zh/book/CADAL02079708/chapter/1l5id200eebkf?version=15","type":"reference-link","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"宋会要辑稿","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"大典","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"宋史·后妃傳上","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"}],"wikisourceLinks":[{"title":"邵氏聞見錄/卷三","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E9%82%B5%E6%B0%8F%E8%81%9E%E8%A6%8B%E9%8C%84%2F%E5%8D%B7%E4%B8%89","origin":"literal-wikitext-link","retrieved":false},{"title":"溫公日記","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E6%BA%AB%E5%85%AC%E6%97%A5%E8%A8%98","origin":"literal-wikitext-link","retrieved":false}],"retrievedAt":"2026-10-02T10:35:03.386Z","attribution":{"source":"Chinese Wikipedia contributors","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0; bibliography metadata only","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","status":"candidate index, not independently verified evidence"}}],"sourceIds":["source:weishu","source:beishi","source:songshi","source:qingshigao","source:zizhitongjian"],"reviewIds":[],"claimIds":[],"matches":[{"documentId":"document:weishu-963b6ca3fd414561","query":"高太后","count":1,"offset":6097,"excerpt":"，誠節皎然，宜褒錫山河，以安厥望。可靈壽縣開國公，邑五百戶。」\n\n初，世宗崩後，高太后將害靈太后。劉騰以告侯剛。剛以告忠。忠請計於崔光，光曰：「宜置胡嬪於別所，嚴加守衞，理必萬全，計之上者。」忠等從之，具以此意啟靈太后，太后意乃安。故太后深德騰等","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:weishu-490ea9efcde90800","query":"高太后","count":1,"offset":8879,"excerpt":"流星起織女，東南流，長且三丈，光明照地。占曰「王后憂之，有女子白衣之會」。間歲，高太后殂，司徒國珍薨，中宮再有喪事。其後僕射于忠，司徒、任城王澄薨。既而太后幽逼，清河、中山王戮死。〔或曰：「月、太白犯歲星，饉祥也；火犯房，陳兵滿野，有饑國，且大赦","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:beishi-f6be890adcbce51c","query":"高太后","count":1,"offset":6655,"excerpt":"甲子，卻鐵匆詣行臺源子恭降。九月戊申，皇太后高氏崩於瑤光寺。冬十月丁卯，以尼禮葬高太后於芒山。十二月辛未，詔曰：「人生有終，下歸兆域。京邑隱振，口盈億萬，貴賤攸憑，未有定所。今制幹脯山以西，擬為九原。」是歲，東夷、西域、北狄十一國並遣使朝貢。\n\n","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:beishi-7829d15c60d2f3c5","query":"高太后","count":1,"offset":3306,"excerpt":"事經肆眚，遂不追罪。又詔以忠歷任禁要，誠節皎然，賜爵靈壽縣公。\n\n初，宣武崩後，高太后將害靈太后。劉騰以告侯剛，剛以告忠。忠請計于崔光。光曰：「宜置胡嬪於別所，嚴兵守衛。」忠從之，具以此意啟靈太后，太后意乃安。故太后深德騰等四人，並有寵授。\n\n忠","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:songshi-d6c631586bf380dd","query":"高太后","count":1,"offset":1254,"excerpt":"后，洺州人，眉州防禦使、馬軍都虞候、贈太尉元之孫女也。\n\n　　初，哲宗既長，宣仁高太后曆選世家女百余入宮。后年十六，宣仁及欽聖向太后皆愛之，教以女儀。元祐七年，諭宰執：「孟氏子能執婦禮，宜正位中宮。」命學士草制。又以近世禮儀簡略，詔翰林、台諫、給","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:qingshigao-6c1709b86cbfabe7","query":"高太后","count":1,"offset":955,"excerpt":"后，遼睿智蕭皇后皆以太后臨朝，史冊稱美。至如宋之章獻劉皇后，有今世任姒之稱，宣仁高太后有女中堯舜之譽。明穆宗皇后，神宗嫡母，上尊號曰仁聖皇太后；穆宗貴妃，神宗生母，上尊號曰慈聖皇太后，惟時神宗十歲，政事皆由兩宮抉擇，命大臣施行，亦未嘗居垂簾之名也","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:zizhitongjian-b6085841e32dc909","query":"高太后","count":3,"offset":1230,"excerpt":"\n\n甲午，魏葬宣武皇帝於景陵，廟號世宗。己亥，尊胡貴嬪為皇太妃。三月，甲辰朔，以高太后為尼，徙居金墉瑤光寺，非大節慶，不得入宮。\n\n魏左僕射郭祚表稱：「蕭衍狂悖，謀斷川瀆，役苦民勞，危亡已兆；宜命將出師，長驅撲討。」魏詔平南將軍楊大眼督諸軍鎮荊山","matchType":"name-occurrence"}],"matchCount":7,"gaps":["身份連結尚未完成編輯核對；同名、異名或同時代關係可能有誤配。","原人物分析及能力數值尚未逐句核對。","來源中的年代、關係與評價仍需逐條轉成有出處的主張。"],"notes":["姓名／重新導向命中，人物身份與每條書目尚須逐項核對。","姓名、分類、時代及稱號保留原庫資料，不自動視為史實。"],"version":"b66c5a60a41e2334","matchedDocuments":[{"id":"document:weishu-963b6ca3fd414561","bookId":"book:weishu","requestedTitle":"魏書/卷31","title":"魏書/卷31","sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E9%AD%8F%E6%9B%B8%2F%E5%8D%B731","revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=468031","historyUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E9%AD%8F%E6%9B%B8%2F%E5%8D%B731?action=history","revisionId":468031,"revisionTimestamp":"2016-07-13T16:34:37Z","retrievedAt":"2026-10-02T10:47:02.656Z","sha256":"12ad8563d8094f45cb2b1babbc07f19a645bb39453a528f4be1b96a67d82e93d","textSha256":"811639ed1cd7350d3caceadfac828799af6a017638f746a93e67286e5826661c","expandedWikitextSha256":"12ad8563d8094f45cb2b1babbc07f19a645bb39453a528f4be1b96a67d82e93d","characters":8024,"contentPath":"/static/data/history/archive-books/weishu.json","status":"downloaded","acquisitionStatus":"downloaded","reuse":"Ancient underlying text; Wikisource transcription attribution and CC BY-SA 4.0 for applicable contributions","extraction":"wikitext-conservative-v2.1.0","normalizedAt":"2026-10-02T11:14:37.513Z","upstreamTextQuality":null,"upstreamTextQualityMeaning":"Wikisource platform quality marker; not a percentage of text transcribed","textCompleteness":"not-independently-collated","extractionNotes":[],"expandedTransclusionTitles":[],"transclusionIssues":[],"transclusions":[],"textPath":"/static/data/history/web/releases/b66c5a60a41e2334/documents/bfc5c7fc318a546a8f13.json","wikitextPath":"/static/data/history/web/releases/b66c5a60a41e2334/wikitext/bfc5c7fc318a546a8f13.json","relatedDocumentIds":[]},{"id":"document:weishu-490ea9efcde90800","bookId":"book:we